						<h2 class="title_contanier" >Student Welfare</h2>
						  <div class="outer-div" style="width: 100%;height: 800px;padding: 0px;overflow: scroll;">
						  <p style="color: #842a0f;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;">
						     <b>Student Development Committee Co-ordinator:-</b>
						     </p>
						      <ul style="color:black ;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 15px;margin-left: 30px;list-style-type: square;">
						      <li>Dr. V.H. Ghadage</li>
						      </ul>
							<p style="color: #842a0f;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;">
						     <b>Student Development Committee:-</b>
						     </p>
						   
						       <ul style="color:black ;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 15px;margin-left: 30px;list-style-type: square;">
			                            <li> <b> Prof. S.N. Mane &nbsp;</b>(Student Development Officer )</li>
			                            <li> <b> Dr. P.B. Pangare &nbsp;</b>(Member) </li>
			                            <li> <b> Dr. V.V. Balghare  &nbsp;</b>(Member)</li>
			                            <li> <b>Dr. B.L. Rathod &nbsp;</b>(Member)</li>
			                            <li> <b> Mr. G.B. Dere &nbsp; </b>(Member)</li>
			                            <li> <b> Ms. S.N. Shekade &nbsp; </b>(Member)</li>
			                            <li> <b> Ms. Nilam Khomane &nbsp; </b>(Member)</li>
			                            <li> <b>Mr. S.L. Sasturkar  &nbsp; </b>(Member)</li>
			                            <li> <b> MS. P.S. Kamble  &nbsp; </b>(Member)</li>
			                            <li> <b> Ms. Anushka Jagdale &nbsp; </b>(Member)</li>
			                            <li> <b>Ms. Gayatri Jadhav  &nbsp; </b>(Member)</li>
			                            <li> <b> Mr. R.S. Landge  &nbsp; </b>(Member)</li>
			                             <li> <b> Mr. A.S. Chandere &nbsp; </b>(Member)</li>
			                            
						       </ul>
							<p style="color: #842a0f;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;">
								<b>Board of Student Development</b> 
							</p>
							<p style="color:black ;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 15px;margin-left: 20px;">
							Our college is Located Semi Urban area it is observed that several of our rural student is coming from remote area and especially the poor. Our college has launched the Department of Student Development
							</p>
							<p style="color:black ;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 15px;margin-left: 20px;">
							Our Department undertakes various activities for the benefit of the student which are economically backward, intelligent but cannot affort higher education.
							</p>
							<p style="color: #842a0f;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;">
								<b>Vision</b> 
							</p>
							<p style="color:black ;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 15px;margin-left: 20px;">
							Train the Student to became with Social awareness.
							</p>
							<p style="color: #842a0f;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;">
								<b>Mission</b> 
							</p>
							<p style="color:black ;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 15px;margin-left: 20px;">
							" Work Is Worship "
							</p>
							<p style="color: #842a0f;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;">
								<b>Objectives</b> 
							</p>
							<p style="color:black ;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 15px;margin-left: 20px;">
							1)To provide Facilities of Earn and Learn<br>
							2)To help student to improve their personalities with the help of organized training programmes<br>
							3) To create dignity among the student.<br>
							4)To provide information releated to scholarships state level  university Level and others.
							</p>
							<p style="color: #842a0f;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;">
								<b>Scheme</b> 
							</p>
							<p style="color:black ;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 15px;margin-left: 20px;">
							<b>Following are the regular Schemes implemented by Board of Development Association</b>
							<br>
							 1) Earn and Learn<br>
							 2) Disaster Management<br>
							 3) Nirbhay Kanya Abhiyan<br>
							 4) Workshop for Students<br>
							 5) Special Guidance Scheme<br>
							 6) Value education<br>
							 7) Personality development for Girls<br>
							</p>
							<p style="color: #842a0f;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;">
								<b>Competitive Examination Cell</b> 
							</p>
							<p style="color:black ;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 15px;margin-left: 20px;">
							Competitive Examination cell established in college to provide support to them for all types of Competitive Examination state Services, Civil Services, Banking Services, NET/SET <br>
							<b>Following Activities are arranged by the Cell</b>
							<br>
							 1) NET / SET guidance workshop for PG students<br>
							 2) Lectures for competitive examination<br>
							</p>
							<p style="color: #842a0f;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;">
								<b>Student Counselling</b> 
							</p>
							<p style="color:black ;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 15px;margin-left: 20px;">
							Student counselling aim to provide advice to student to make them aware of their career counselling help the student to realize their strength and weakness. This center counselling services provided to the college student
														
							</p>
							<p style="color: #842a0f;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;">
								<b>Objectives</b> 
							</p>
							<p style="color:black ;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 15px;margin-left: 20px;">
							 1) To promote career guidance and counselling through by expert<br>
							 2) To Organize program for various skills<br>
							</p>
